<title>BELGIUM: EU economic forecast for Ireland.</title>
<headline>EU economic forecast for Ireland.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Ireland:</p>
<p>				     1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		7.8	   5.8</p>
<p> Investment			8.0	   7.5</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    2.0	   2.2</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	   12.5	  12.0</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	 1.6	   0.9</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		 74.7	  70.0</p>
</text>
